### TerraShield AI — API examples (VS Code REST Client / IntelliJ HTTP)
@base = http://localhost:8000/api/v1

### Health + EarthData Engine status
GET {{base}}/health

###
GET {{base}}/earthdata/status

### Validate an AOI (Satara, Maharashtra)
POST {{base}}/earthdata/aoi/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "bbox", "bbox": [73.9, 17.6, 74.3, 18.0] }

### FloodAI — susceptibility under extreme rainfall
POST {{base}}/flood/susceptibility
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "aoi": { "type": "bbox", "bbox": [73.9, 17.6, 74.3, 18.0] },
  "rainfall_scenario": "extreme"
}

### FloodAI — susceptibility with AHP-derived weights (pairwise matrix)
POST {{base}}/flood/susceptibility
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "aoi": { "type": "bbox", "bbox": [73.9, 17.6, 74.3, 18.0] },
  "ahp_matrix": [
    [1, 2, 2, 3, 4, 5],
    [0.5, 1, 1, 2, 3, 4],
    [0.5, 1, 1, 2, 3, 4],
    [0.333, 0.5, 0.5, 1, 2, 3],
    [0.25, 0.333, 0.333, 0.5, 1, 2],
    [0.2, 0.25, 0.25, 0.333, 0.5, 1]
  ]
}

### ClimateLens — SSP585 precipitation, 2050s
POST {{base}}/climate/projection
Content-Type: application/json

{ "aoi": { "type": "bbox", "bbox": [73.9, 17.6, 74.3, 18.0] },
  "scenario": "ssp585", "variable": "pr", "horizon": "2050s" }

### DroughtAI — 3-month SPI
POST {{base}}/drought/spi
Content-Type: application/json

{ "aoi": { "type": "bbox", "bbox": [73.9, 17.6, 74.3, 18.0] }, "scale_months": 3 }

### ResilienceOR — relief-shelter siting (MCLP)
POST {{base}}/optimize/shelters
Content-Type: application/json

{ "aoi": { "type": "bbox", "bbox": [73.9, 17.6, 74.3, 18.0] },
  "num_shelters": 4, "radius_km": 8 }

### ResilienceOR — evacuation routing (Dijkstra)
POST {{base}}/optimize/evacuation
Content-Type: application/json

{ "aoi": { "type": "bbox", "bbox": [73.9, 17.6, 74.3, 18.0] } }

### ResilienceOR — mitigation knapsack
POST {{base}}/optimize/mitigation
Content-Type: application/json

{ "budget": 200 }

### ResilienceOR — default AHP flood weights
GET {{base}}/optimize/ahp/default

### GeoCopilot — natural-language query (resolves any Indian district)
POST {{base}}/copilot/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "How will flood risk in Satara change under SSP585 by 2050?" }

###
POST {{base}}/copilot/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "Where should we place 4 relief shelters in Kolhapur?" }
